[
{ type: install
  message: <<EOM
The modules.d and monitors.d files are now installed into
%%EXAMPLESDIR%%

Metricbeat system metrics require an enabled system module. To enable it:

  cp -n %%EXAMPLESDIR%%/metricbeat.modules.d/system.yml \
    %%ETCDIR%%/metricbeat.modules.d/system.yml

CPU metrics require linprocfs mounted at /compat/linux/proc.
If it is not already mounted, add this line to /etc/fstab:

  linprocfs /compat/linux/proc linprocfs rw 0 0

Then create the mount point and mount it:

  mkdir -p /compat/linux/proc
  mount /compat/linux/proc

See UPDATING file in ports top level directory for list of breaking changes.
EOM
}
]
